
### BLOCKING

POST http://localhost:8080/chat HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "question": "Can you write a small poem?"
}

### STREAM

POST http://localhost:8080/chat/stream HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
    "question": "Can you write a large poem?"
}
